### 1.2 DARPA ISAT (Information Science and Technology Study Group)

**ISAT does not issue direct funding** — it produces classified and unclassified study reports that inform future DARPA BAAs. No specific ISAT study on hardware reliability has been publicly announced for 2024–2026. ISAT studies typically precede program launches by 1–2 years, so any current work on this topic represents future program seeds rather than near-term funding.

Source: [Vanderbilt ISAT 2024 appointment](https://engineering.vanderbilt.edu/2024/05/31/wisniewski-named-to-darpa-isat-study-group-to-assess-future-research-directions-in-computer-science/)

